to-be-incorporated-into-paper-138 : List Word
to-be-incorporated-into-paper-138 = unlines (cons "In hyperactivity's language as the repository implements it: **Indexed families.** `data Vec (A : Type) : (n : Nat) → Type where vnil : Vec A zero; vcons :" (cons "(n : Nat) → A → Vec A n → Vec A (suc n)` declares the family by fording (PLAN.md revision 7.9, 6 Nov 2026, git 2ca8d747aaa5:PLAN.md, §18.12 “E28 — Elaboration”): the indices" (cons "are the type's last parameters, each constructor carries an equality field per index at" (cons "multiplicity 0 (`PathP (λ m → Nat) %ix0 (suc n)`, erased), an application without the equality" (cons "fields gets `refl`, a pattern without them is padded, and a branch that writes them (`vcons n x" (cons "xs e`) transports along `e` or refutes it (`vtail`'s `vnil` case by `snotz`). The recursion rule" (cons "wants the index implicit (`{n : Nat} → Vec A n → …`). A recursion whose index argument is a" (cons "variable has its induction hypothesis at the field's own index (`vmap f xs : Vec B m` for `xs :" (cons "Vec A m`): the motive is written `(λ ix v → Vec B ix) n` and the checker reads it so (the index" (cons "unified at the split, as Agda does). Leaving the equality field out of the pattern rewrites the" (cons "goal by it: `vmap f (vcons m x xs) = vcons m (f x) (vmap f xs)` is checked at `Vec B (suc m)`" (cons "and transported along the equation; naming it (`vcons m x xs e`) leaves it to the branch." (cons "Indices are unified at a split as Agda does: a case whose indices clash may be left out" (cons "(`vhead (vcons m x xs) = x` on `Vec A (suc n)`), a field determined by the indices is solved" (cons "(`vzip (vcons m x xs) (vcons m2 y ys) = vcons m (x , y) (vzip xs ys)` with `ys : Vec B m`), and" (cons "a missing clause is covered when a later argument's type is empty (`vlookup` needs no `vnil`" (cons "clause: `Fin zero` has no constructor)." nil)))))))))))))))))
